(49, '[hod@cse.udsm.ac.tz](mailto:hod@cse.udsm.ac.tz)', '', '', 'To: [staff@cse.udsm.ac.tz](mailto:staff@cse.udsm.ac.tz)\n\nSubject: Department Meeting Schedule\n\nDear Staff Members,\n\nYou are invited to attend the monthly Computer Science department meeting scheduled for Friday at 2:00 PM in Room B12.\n\nAgenda:\n\n* Research updates\n* Semester planning\n* Student supervision progress\n\nMeeting details are also available on the department portal:\nhttps://cse.udsm.ac.tz\n\nBest regards,\nHead of Department\nComputer Science and Engineering', '', '{\'from\': \'[hod@cse.udsm.ac.tz](mailto:hod@cse.udsm.ac.tz)\'}', '2026-05-14 03:49:03', '127.0.0.1', 'en'),
