(55, '[neema.mashauri@gmail.com](mailto:neema.mashauri@gmail.com)', '', '', 'To: [teacher@school.ac.tz](mailto:teacher@school.ac.tz)\n\nSubject: Request for Student Progress Update\n\nDear Teacher,\n\nI hope you are doing well.\n\nI would like to kindly ask about the academic progress of my son, Daniel Mashauri, in Mathematics and English subjects this semester.\n\nPlease let me know if there are any areas where he needs improvement or additional support at home.\n\nThank you for your dedication and support to the students.\n\nBest regards,\nNeema Mashauri\nParent', '', '{\'from\': \'[neema.mashauri@gmail.com](mailto:neema.mashauri@gmail.com)\'}', '2026-05-14 03:55:52', '127.0.0.1', 'en'),
(56, '[youthministry@stpeters.or.tz](mailto:youthministry@stpeters.or.tz)', '', '', 'To: [member@gmail.com](mailto:member@gmail.com)\n\nSubject: Sunday Youth Fellowship Reminder\n\nDear Members,\n\nThis is a friendly reminder that the Youth Fellowship meeting will take place this Sunday at 3:00 PM in the church hall.\n\nTopic:\nBuilding Responsible Digital Habits\n\nEveryone is welcome to attend.\n\nGod bless you all.\n\nRegards,\nYouth Ministry Team\nSt. Peters Church', '', '{\'from\': \'[youthministry@stpeters.or.tz](mailto:youthministry@stpeters.or.tz)\'}', '2026-05-14 03:56:38', '127.0.0.1', 'en'),
(57, '[nyumbaowner@gmail.com](mailto:nyumbaowner@gmail.com)', '', '', 'To: [tenant@gmail.com](mailto:tenant@gmail.com)\n\nSubject: Water Maintenance Notice\n\nHello,\n\nThere will be water maintenance in the apartment building tomorrow from 9:00 AM to 1:00 PM due to pipe repairs.\n\nPlease store enough water before that time.\n\nSorry for the inconvenience.\n\nThank you,\nBuilding Management', '', '{\'from\': \'[nyumbaowner@gmail.com](mailto:nyumbaowner@gmail.com)\'}', '2026-05-14 03:57:22', '127.0.0.1', 'en'),
(58, '[brian.kileo@gmail.com](mailto:brian.kileo@gmail.com)', '', '', 'To: [classmate@gmail.com](mailto:classmate@gmail.com)\n\nSubject: Lecture Notes for Computer Networks\n\nHi John,\n\nI have attached the lecture notes for today\'s Computer Networks class.\n\nThe lecturer emphasized TCP/IP and routing protocols, so make sure you revise those sections before the quiz next week.\n\nLet me know if you have any questions.\n\nThanks,\nBrian', '', '{\'from\': \'[brian.kileo@gmail.com](mailto:brian.kileo@gmail.com)\'}', '2026-05-14 03:58:20', '127.0.0.1', 'en'),
(59, '[mama_ntilie_business@yahoo.com](mailto:mama_ntilie_business@yahoo.com)', '', '', 'To: [customer@gmail.com](mailto:customer@gmail.com)\n\nSubject: Delivery Confirmation\n\nDear Customer,\n\nYour food order has been prepared and will be delivered within the next 30 minutes.\n\nItems ordered:\n\n* Pilau\n* Beef Stew\n* Soda\n\nThank you for supporting our business.\n\nRegards,\nMama Ntilie Kitchen', '', '{\'from\': \'[mama_ntilie_business@yahoo.com](mailto:mama_ntilie_business@yahoo.com)\'}', '2026-05-14 03:58:54', '127.0.0.1', 'en'),
(60, 'security@crdb-verify.xyz', '', 'URGENT: Your CRDB account has been suspended', 'Dear Customer,\n\nYour CRDB Bank account has been SUSPENDED due to suspicious activity. You must verify your account immediately or it will be permanently closed.\n\nClick here to verify: http://crdb-secure-login.tk/verify?token=abc123\n\nPlease provide your:\n- Account number\n- PIN number\n- Date of birth\n\nYou have 24 hours to act or your account will be deleted.\n\nCRDB Bank Security Team', '', '{\'from\': \'CRDB Bank Security <security@crdb-verify.xyz>\', \'subject\': \'URGENT: Your CRDB account has been suspended\'}', '2026-05-14 04:03:43', '127.0.0.1', 'en'),
(61, 'winner@lottery-prize.ml', '', 'CONGRATULATIONS! You have won $1,500,000', 'Dear Winner,\n\nCongratulations! You have been selected as the winner of our International Online Lottery for this week. Your email address was randomly selected from 50,000 entries.\n\nYour prize: $1,500,000 USD (One Million Five Hundred Thousand US Dollars)\n\nTo claim your prize, send the following:\n- Full name\n- Bank account number\n- Routing number\n- Copy of your national ID\n\nContact our claims officer: agent@gmail.com\nThis offer expires in 48 hours. Act now!\n\nMr. James Williams\nInternational Lottery Foundation', '', '{\'from\': \'International Lottery Foundation <winner@lottery-prize.ml>\', \'subject\': \'CONGRATULATIONS! You have won $1,500,000\'}', '2026-05-14 04:04:11', '127.0.0.1', 'en'),
(62, 'hassan.mwamba@company-group.net', '', 'Confidential - Urgent Wire Transfer Needed', 'Hi Sarah,\n\nI need you to process an urgent wire transfer today. I\'m in a meeting and can\'t talk. Please keep this confidential as it\'s for a sensitive acquisition.\n\nTransfer Details:\nAmount: $47,500\nBank: First National Bank\nAccount: 8834521987\nRouting: 021000021\nReference: Acquisition-Q4\n\nPlease confirm once done. Do NOT discuss this with anyone else.\n\nDr. Hassan Mwamba\nCEO, Mwamba Group', '', '{\'from\': \'Dr. Hassan Mwamba <hassan.mwamba@company-group.net>\', \'subject\': \'Confidential - Urgent Wire Transfer Needed\'}', '2026-05-14 04:04:31', '127.0.0.1', 'en'),
(63, 'registrar@udsm.ac.tz', '', 'Course Registration Confirmation - Semester 1 2024/2025', 'Dear John Msangi,\n\nYour course registration for Semester 1, 2024/2025 academic year has been successfully processed. Below are your registered courses:\n\n1. CS 401 - Software Engineering (3 Credits)\n2. CS 405 - Database Systems (3 Credits)\n3. CS 412 - Computer Networks (3 Credits)\n\nYour student portal is available at: https://portal.udsm.ac.tz\n\nIf you have any questions, contact the Registrar\'s Office:\nEmail: registrar@udsm.ac.tz\nPhone: +255 22 241 0500\n\nBest regards,\nUniversity of Dar es Salaam\nRegistrar\'s Office', '', '{\'from\': \'registrar@udsm.ac.tz\', \'subject\': \'Course Registration Confirmation - Semester 1 2024/2025\'}', '2026-05-14 04:04:51', '127.0.0.1', 'en'),
