(114, '[library@udom.ac.tz](mailto:library@udom.ac.tz)', '', '', 'To: [student22@gmail.com](mailto:student@gmail.com)\n\nSubject: Library Book Return Reminder for student\n\nDear Student,\n\nThis is a reminder that the following borrowed library book is due for return on 20 May 2026:\n\nBook Title:\nIntroduction to Computer Security\n\nPlease return the book before the due date to avoid late return penalties.\n\nLibrary Portal:\nhttps://library.udom.ac.tz\n\nThank you.\n\nRegards,\nUDOM Library Services', '', '{\'from\': \'[library@udom.ac.tz](mailto:library@udom.ac.tz)\'}', '2026-05-14 05:06:28', '127.0.0.1', 'en'),
(115, '[library@udom.ac.tz](mailto:library@udom.ac.tz)', '', '', 'To: [student@gmail.com](mailto:student@gmail.com)\n\nSubject: Library Book Return Reminder for student\n\nDear Student,\n\nThis is a reminder that the following borrowed library book is due for return on 20 May 2026:\n\nBook Title:\nIntroduction to Computer Security\n\nPlease return the book before the due date to avoid late return penalties.\n\nLibrary Portal:\nhttps://library.udom.ac.tz\n\nThank you.\n\nRegards,\nUDOM Library Services', '', '{\'from\': \'[library@udom.ac.tz](mailto:library@udom.ac.tz)\'}', '2026-05-14 05:06:42', '127.0.0.1', 'en'),
(116, 'recruitment@jobs-africa-careers.com', '', 'Exciting Job Opportunity - Earn $5,000/month Working From Home', 'Hello,\n\nWe found your profile online and believe you are a great candidate for our data entry position. Earn $5,000 per month working from home, no experience required!\n\nRequirements:\n- Must have a bank account\n- Available 2 hours per day\n\nTo apply, visit: http://bit.ly/afr-jobs-2024\n\nReply to this email with your details.\n\nHR Department', '', '{\'from\': \'recruitment@jobs-africa-careers.com\', \'subject\': \'Exciting Job Opportunity - Earn $5,000/month Working From Home\'}', '2026-05-14 05:07:18', '127.0.0.1', 'en'),
(117, 'crdb security [secure-crdbverify@gmail.com](mailto:secure-crdbverify@gmail.com)', '', '', 'To: [customer@gmail.com](mailto:customer@gmail.com)\n\nSubject: Account Verification Required Immediately\n\nDear Customer,\n\nWe detected suspicious activity on your CRDB account.\n\nTo avoid temporary suspension, verify your account immediately using the secure link below:\n\nhttps://crdb-secure-login.xyz/verify-account\n\nPlease confirm:\n\n* ATM Number\n* PIN\n* Mobile Number\n* Internet Banking Password\n\nFailure to verify within 24 hours will result in account deactivation.\n\nRegards,\nCRDB Security Team', '', '{\'from\': \'CRDB Security [secure-crdbverify@gmail.com](mailto:secure-crdbverify@gmail.com)\'}', '2026-05-14 05:49:47', '127.0.0.1', 'en'),
(118, '[recruitment@un-job-opportunity.click](mailto:recruitment@un-job-opportunity.click)', '', '', 'To: [applicant@gmail.com](mailto:applicant@gmail.com)\n\nSubject: Congratulations! You Have Been Selected\n\nDear Applicant,\n\nCongratulations! You have been selected for an international remote job opportunity with a monthly salary of USD 4,500.\n\nTo secure your position, complete registration immediately below:\n\nhttps://un-job-opportunity.click/apply\n\nYou must submit:\n\n* Passport copy\n* National ID\n* Bank details\n\nLimited slots remaining.\n\nBest regards,\nRecruitment Department', '', '{\'from\': \'[recruitment@un-job-opportunity.click](mailto:recruitment@un-job-opportunity.click)\'}', '2026-05-14 05:51:51', '127.0.0.1', 'en'),
(119, 'ict support [support@udsm-portal-access.net](mailto:support@udsm-portal-access.net)', '', '', 'To: [student@gmail.com](mailto:student@gmail.com)\n\nSubject: Student Portal Access Suspended\n\nDear Student,\n\nYour student portal access has been temporarily suspended due to unusual login activity.\n\nRestore your account immediately:\nhttp://192.168.1.20/student-login\n\nFailure to act today may affect examination access and results processing.\n\nRegards,\nUDSM ICT Department', '', '{\'from\': \'ICT Support [support@udsm-portal-access.net](mailto:support@udsm-portal-access.net)\'}', '2026-05-14 05:52:42', '127.0.0.1', 'en'),
(120, '[internships@tanesco.co.tz](mailto:internships@tanesco.co.tz)', '', '', 'To: [student@gmail.com](mailto:student@gmail.com)\n\nSubject: Internship Placement Confirmation\n\nDear Student,\n\nWe are pleased to inform you that your internship application has been approved.\n\nReporting Date:\n20 May 2026\n\nLocation:\nTANESCO Headquarters\nUbungo, Dar es Salaam\n\nPlease carry your university introduction letter and student ID on the reporting day.\n\nFor more information:\nhttps://www.tanesco.co.tz\n\nRegards,\nHuman Resources Department\nTANESCO', '', '{\'from\': \'[internships@tanesco.co.tz](mailto:internships@tanesco.co.tz)\'}', '2026-05-14 05:53:22', '127.0.0.1', 'en'),
(121, '[aunt.rehema@gmail.com](mailto:aunt.rehema@gmail.com)', '', '', 'To: [familymember@gmail.com](mailto:familymember@gmail.com)\n\nSubject: Family Meeting This Saturday\n\nHello Everyone,\n\nThis is a reminder that we will have our family meeting this Saturday at 4 PM at grandmother\'s house.\n\nWe will discuss preparations for the graduation ceremony next month.\n\nPlease arrive on time.\n\nThank you,\nAunt Rehema', '', '{\'from\': \'[aunt.rehema@gmail.com](mailto:aunt.rehema@gmail.com)\'}', '2026-05-14 05:53:42', '127.0.0.1', 'en'),
(122, '[billing-notify@fileshare-secure.com](mailto:billing-notify@fileshare-secure.com)', '', '', 'To: [employee@gmail.com](mailto:employee@gmail.com)\n\nSubject: Invoice Shared With You\n\nDear User,\n\nAn invoice document has been shared with you for review.\n\nAccess the document below:\nhttps://fileshare-secure.com/open/invoice\n\nThis secure link will expire within 6 hours.\n\nRegards,\nBilling Notification Service', '', '{\'from\': \'[billing-notify@fileshare-secure.com](mailto:billing-notify@fileshare-secure.com)\'}', '2026-05-14 05:54:08', '127.0.0.1', 'en'),
(123, 'billing-notify@fileshare-secure.com', 'employee@gmail.com', 'Invoice Shared With You', 'Dear User,\n\nAn invoice document has been shared with you for review.\n\nAccess the document below:\nhttps://fileshare-secure.com/open/invoice\n\nThis secure link will expire within 6 hours.\n\nRegards,\nBilling Notification Service', '', '{}', '2026-05-14 05:55:08', '127.0.0.1', 'en'),
(124, 'recruitment@jobs-africa-careers.com', '', 'Exciting Job Opportunity - Earn $5,000/month Working From Home', 'Hello,\n\nWe found your profile online and believe you are a great candidate for our data entry position. Earn $5,000 per month working from home, no experience required!\n\nRequirements:\n- Must have a bank account\n- Available 2 hours per day\n\nTo apply, visit: http://bit.ly/afr-jobs-2024\n\nReply to this email with your details.\n\nHR Department', '', '{\'from\': \'recruitment@jobs-africa-careers.com\', \'subject\': \'Exciting Job Opportunity - Earn $5,000/month Working From Home\'}', '2026-05-14 05:56:02', '127.0.0.1', 'en'),
(125, 'winner@lottery-prize.ml', '', 'CONGRATULATIONS! You have won $1,500,000', 'Dear Winner,\n\nCongratulations! You have been selected as the winner of our International Online Lottery for this week. Your email address was randomly selected from 50,000 entries.\n\nYour prize: $1,500,000 USD (One Million Five Hundred Thousand US Dollars)\n\nTo claim your prize, send the following:\n- Full name\n- Bank account number\n- Routing number\n- Copy of your national ID\n\nContact our claims officer: agent@gmail.com\nThis offer expires in 48 hours. Act now!\n\nMr. James Williams\nInternational Lottery Foundation', '', '{\'from\': \'International Lottery Foundation <winner@lottery-prize.ml>\', \'subject\': \'CONGRATULATIONS! You have won $1,500,000\'}', '2026-05-14 05:56:22', '127.0.0.1', 'en'),
(126, 'hassan.mwamba@company-group.net', '', 'Confidential - Urgent Wire Transfer Needed', 'Hi Sarah,\n\nI need you to process an urgent wire transfer today. I\'m in a meeting and can\'t talk. Please keep this confidential as it\'s for a sensitive acquisition.\n\nTransfer Details:\nAmount: $47,500\nBank: First National Bank\nAccount: 8834521987\nRouting: 021000021\nReference: Acquisition-Q4\n\nPlease confirm once done. Do NOT discuss this with anyone else.\n\nDr. Hassan Mwamba\nCEO, Mwamba Group', '', '{\'from\': \'Dr. Hassan Mwamba <hassan.mwamba@company-group.net>\', \'subject\': \'Confidential - Urgent Wire Transfer Needed\'}', '2026-05-14 06:12:38', '127.0.0.1', 'en'),
(127, 'recruitment@jobs-africa-careers.com', '', 'Exciting Job Opportunity - Earn $5,000/month Working From Home', 'Hello,\n\nWe found your profile online and believe you are a great candidate for our data entry position. Earn $5,000 per month working from home, no experience required!\n\nRequirements:\n- Must have a bank account\n- Available 2 hours per day\n\nTo apply, visit: http://bit.ly/afr-jobs-2024\n\nReply to this email with your details.\n\nHR Department', '', '{\'from\': \'recruitment@jobs-africa-careers.com\', \'subject\': \'Exciting Job Opportunity - Earn $5,000/month Working From Home\'}', '2026-05-14 06:13:01', '127.0.0.1', 'en'),
(128, 'alerts@nmbbank.co.tz', '', 'Transaction Alert: Debit of TZS 25,000 on your account', 'Dear Amina Juma,\n\nA transaction has been processed on your account:\n\nType:        Debit\nAmount:      TZS 25,000\nDescription: AIRTEL MONEY TRANSFER\nDate/Time:   2024-11-15 14:32:05\nBalance:     TZS 342,150\n\nIf you did not authorise this transaction, contact us immediately:\n- Call: 0800 750 002 (toll free)\n- Visit: https://www.nmbbank.co.tz\n- Branch: Your nearest NMB branch\n\nNMB Bank PLC\nThis is an automated alert. Please do not reply to this email.', '', '{\'from\': \'alerts@nmbbank.co.tz\', \'subject\': \'Transaction Alert: Debit of TZS 25,000 on your account\'}', '2026-05-14 06:13:25', '127.0.0.1', 'en');
